      "source": "## Monte Carlo Convergence and Static Equity Analytics\n\nThis section uses the notebook's existing `calculate_equity()` and `HandEvaluator` implementation. It generates the convergence plot, 13\u00d713 starting-hand heatmap, and normalized post-flop outcome chart. The baseline is an estimate (100,000 simulations), not exact equity. The CLT predicts standard-error/absolute-error scaling of $O(N^{-1/2})$; variance scales as $O(1/N)$.",
